1
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:08,308
Hi! I'm Sofia. And this is my friend Gus.

2
00:00:08,508 --> 00:00:09,348
Hello!

3
00:00:09,548 --> 00:00:15,491
Today we are going to the city center. It's my mom's birthday tomorrow. I need a present.

4
00:00:15,691 --> 00:00:17,185
And I need a burger.

5
00:00:17,385 --> 00:00:19,532
Of course you do.

6
00:00:19,582 --> 00:00:28,538
In this story, you will learn how to ask for directions, how to shop, and how to ask for help. Let's go!

7
00:00:29,138 --> 00:00:33,807
Okay, Gus. The city is very big. Please stay with me.

8
00:00:34,007 --> 00:00:36,688
Yes, yes. I will stay with you.

9
00:00:36,888 --> 00:00:39,495
Don't go far. Do you understand?

10
00:00:39,695 --> 00:00:43,176
I understand. I'm not a baby. I'm a goose.

11
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,276
That's the problem.

12
00:00:48,376 --> 00:00:52,836
Oh, look! A flower shop. Mom loves flowers.

13
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:55,515
Wait here, Gus. I'll be back in two minutes.

14
00:00:55,715 --> 00:00:58,114
Okay. Two minutes. No problem.

15
00:01:00,414 --> 00:01:02,593
Hmm... What is that smell?

16
00:01:02,643 --> 00:01:03,582
Burgers!

17
00:01:03,632 --> 00:01:06,773
Two for one? Two burgers for one price?

18
00:01:06,823 --> 00:01:09,741
I have to see this. Just for one minute...

19
00:01:15,991 --> 00:01:20,355
Where is the burger place? It was here... I think.

20
00:01:20,405 --> 00:01:24,517
Hmm. This street is different. Where is the flower shop?

21
00:01:24,567 --> 00:01:26,050
Where is Sofia?

22
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:30,921
Okay. Don't panic, Gus. Take your phone. Call Sofia.

23
00:01:31,521 --> 00:01:34,004
No, no, no! My phone is dead!

24
00:01:34,054 --> 00:01:37,311
I'm lost! I'm a lost goose in a big city!

25
00:01:37,811 --> 00:01:41,481
Okay. Calm down. I can ask someone for help.

26
00:01:41,531 --> 00:01:43,777
People are nice. Probably.

27
00:01:46,827 --> 00:01:49,509
Excuse me. Sorry to bother you.

28
00:01:49,709 --> 00:01:51,829
Yes, dear? Can I help you?

29
00:01:52,029 --> 00:01:55,723
I think I'm lost. I'm looking for a flower shop.

30
00:01:55,923 --> 00:02:01,955
A flower shop? There are many flower shops in this city. What is the name of the street?

31
00:02:02,155 --> 00:02:05,441
I don't know. It's next to a big burger place.

32
00:02:05,641 --> 00:02:08,989
Ah! Big Burger! It's on Green Street.

33
00:02:09,189 --> 00:02:12,056
Yes! That's it! How do I get there?

34
00:02:12,256 --> 00:02:16,482
It's easy. Go straight. Then turn left at the bank.

35
00:02:16,502 --> 00:02:20,281
Then go past the park. Green Street is on your right.

36
00:02:20,481 --> 00:02:25,779
Go straight... turn left at the bank... past the park... on my right.

37
00:02:25,979 --> 00:02:28,937
That's right. It takes about ten minutes.

38
00:02:29,137 --> 00:02:30,839
Ten minutes? On foot?

39
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:34,259
On foot. Or five minutes if you fly.

40
00:02:34,459 --> 00:02:39,304
Ha! I'm a goose, but I don't fly. I walk. Thank you so much!

41
00:02:39,504 --> 00:02:41,821
You're welcome, dear. Good luck!

42
00:02:44,421 --> 00:02:47,536
Okay. The bank. Turn... left? Or right?

43
00:02:47,836 --> 00:02:49,760
Right. Right is right!

44
00:02:58,410 --> 00:03:01,565
Hmm. This is not a park. This is a shop.

45
00:03:01,765 --> 00:03:03,440
Hello! Can I help you?

46
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:06,514
Yes, please. Do you sell phone chargers?

47
00:03:06,714 --> 00:03:09,823
Sorry, we don't. But we have maps.

48
00:03:10,023 --> 00:03:12,601
A map! Perfect. How much is it?

49
00:03:12,801 --> 00:03:14,266
It's five dollars.

50
00:03:14,466 --> 00:03:18,453
I have... three dollars. And a coupon for burgers.

51
00:03:18,653 --> 00:03:21,180
Sorry, the coupon doesn't work here.

52
00:03:21,380 --> 00:03:22,889
Can I pay by card?

53
00:03:23,089 --> 00:03:24,676
Yes, of course.

54
00:03:24,876 --> 00:03:27,355
Oh no. My card is at home.

55
00:03:27,955 --> 00:03:31,172
Okay... Here's a small map. It's free.

56
00:03:31,372 --> 00:03:34,449
Really? Thank you! You are very kind.

57
00:03:34,649 --> 00:03:36,769
No problem. Where do you want to go?

58
00:03:36,969 --> 00:03:39,516
Green Street. Next to Big Burger.

59
00:03:39,716 --> 00:03:42,725
We are here. Green Street is here.

60
00:03:42,775 --> 00:03:46,858
You went the wrong way. Turn left at the bank, not right.

61
00:03:47,158 --> 00:03:49,577
Left. Of course. I knew that.

62
00:03:50,177 --> 00:03:54,480
Excuse me, can I use your phone? I need to call my friend.

63
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,348
Sure. Here you are.

64
00:03:57,048 --> 00:03:59,736
Hmm... I don't remember her number.

65
00:03:59,786 --> 00:04:03,454
I know the burger menu by heart. But not her number.

66
00:04:10,704 --> 00:04:15,398
Okay, Gus, I'm ready! ...Gus? Gus?

67
00:04:15,448 --> 00:04:18,329
Where is he? I said wait here!

68
00:04:21,029 --> 00:04:23,888
The number you are calling is not available.

69
00:04:24,088 --> 00:04:29,545
Oh no. His phone is dead. Again.

70
00:04:31,245 --> 00:04:36,905
Excuse me, officer! Can you help me, please? I lost my friend.

71
00:04:37,105 --> 00:04:39,830
Of course. What does your friend look like?

72
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:46,381
He is tall. He is white. He has a long neck and an orange nose.

73
00:04:46,581 --> 00:04:49,115
A long neck and an orange nose?

74
00:04:49,315 --> 00:04:51,405
And he's wearing a blue tie.

75
00:04:51,605 --> 00:04:54,210
Miss... is your friend a goose?

76
00:04:54,410 --> 00:04:56,924
Yes. Is that a problem?

77
00:04:57,124 --> 00:05:00,039
No, no. Where did you see him last?

78
00:05:00,239 --> 00:05:03,781
Here. Next to the flower shop. About twenty minutes ago.

79
00:05:03,981 --> 00:05:06,721
Hmm. Is there a place he loves?

80
00:05:06,921 --> 00:05:09,781
Food. He loves burgers.

81
00:05:09,981 --> 00:05:11,263
Like Big Burger?

82
00:05:11,463 --> 00:05:14,106
Of course! Thank you, officer!

83
00:05:21,206 --> 00:05:26,927
Go straight... turn left at the bank... past the park... Green Street! I did it!

84
00:05:27,627 --> 00:05:30,007
Gus!

85
00:05:30,207 --> 00:05:31,145
Sofia!

86
00:05:32,445 --> 00:05:35,583
Where were you? I was so worried!

87
00:05:35,783 --> 00:05:41,799
I'm sorry. I smelled burgers. Then I got lost. Then my phone died.

88
00:05:41,999 --> 00:05:44,187
I said wait here.

89
00:05:44,387 --> 00:05:52,045
I know. But I learned a lot today. I asked for directions. I went to a shop. I got a free map!

90
00:05:52,245 --> 00:05:56,453
You asked for help in English? I'm proud of you.

91
00:05:56,653 --> 00:05:59,211
Thank you. Now... two for one?

92
00:05:59,411 --> 00:06:02,712
Okay. But this time you stay with me.

93
00:06:02,912 --> 00:06:05,507
I promise. ...After the burgers.

94
00:06:09,607 --> 00:06:13,927
Now it's practice time! Listen and repeat after me. Ready?

95
00:06:14,627 --> 00:06:16,974
Excuse me. Can you help me?

96
00:06:20,074 --> 00:06:22,422
Excuse me. Can you help me?

97
00:06:23,322 --> 00:06:24,770
I think I'm lost.

98
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:29,318
I think I'm lost.

99
00:06:30,218 --> 00:06:31,939
How do I get to Green Street?

100
00:06:35,039 --> 00:06:36,761
How do I get to Green Street?

101
00:06:37,661 --> 00:06:41,264
Go straight. Turn left. Turn right.

102
00:06:44,364 --> 00:06:47,967
Go straight. Turn left. Turn right.

103
00:06:48,867 --> 00:06:50,151
It's on your right.

104
00:06:53,251 --> 00:06:54,534
It's on your right.

105
00:06:55,434 --> 00:06:56,466
How much is it?

106
00:06:59,566 --> 00:07:00,598
How much is it?

107
00:07:01,498 --> 00:07:02,936
Can I pay by card?

108
00:07:06,036 --> 00:07:07,474
Can I pay by card?

109
00:07:08,374 --> 00:07:10,514
Can I use your phone, please?

110
00:07:13,614 --> 00:07:15,754
Can I use your phone, please?

111
00:07:16,654 --> 00:07:18,351
I lost my friend.

112
00:07:21,451 --> 00:07:23,148
I lost my friend.

113
00:07:24,048 --> 00:07:25,429
What does he look like?

114
00:07:28,529 --> 00:07:29,910
What does he look like?

115
00:07:31,010 --> 00:07:38,572
Quick question! At the bank, Gus turned right. Was that correct? Write your answer in the comments!

116
00:07:41,272 --> 00:07:46,604
Great job! Now you can ask for directions, shop, and ask for help in English.

117
00:07:46,804 --> 00:07:48,372
And find burgers.

118
00:07:48,472 --> 00:07:51,652
Subscribe for the next story! Bye!

119
00:07:51,752 --> 00:07:54,606
Bye! ...Wait. Where is the exit?
